  dialogues:
  - name: Intro
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 37eb1df14c42bff4bbde4b40b599711c, type: 3}
    sentences:
    - "The oldest generation often talked about the time before the cold and the\t
      dark."
    - To combat the damage of overpopulation great cities were built, capable of
      housing millions of people.
    - As global warming grew more and more severe, scientists created great machines.
    - 'They flooded the sky with particles to deflect the rays of the sun to cool
      down the planet. '
    - It worked.
    - But the temperature dropped too much, too fast. A new ice age began.
    - Chaos descended on the megacities as everyone fought over the dwindling resources.
    - The ones who survived huddled together, forming small pockets to survive.
    - 'Generations have passed since then. '
    - 'In one of the megacities, Neokalmar, explorers and scavengers leave their
      villages to forage the now desolate city. '
    - Looking for anything that can be used to maintain their little societies.
    - "Those exploring the city must be careful. Any expedition could be their\u2026"
    - Last Descent
  - name: Tutorial
    portrait: {fileID: 10907, guid: 0000000000000000f000000000000000, type: 0}
    sentences:
    - Left Click on the ground to move.
